      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A Psalm ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "or",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Song for the sons of Korah. His foundation ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in the holy mountains.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.87.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.87.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The LORD loveth the gates of Zion more than all the dwellings of Jacob.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.87.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.87.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Glorious things are spoken of thee, O city of God. Selah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.87.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.87.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I will make mention of Rahab and Babylon to them that know me: behold Philistia, and Tyre, with Cush; this ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "man",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " was born there.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.87.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.87.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And of Zion it shall be said, This and that man was born in her: and the Highest himself shall establish her.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.87.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.87.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The LORD shall count, when he writeth up the people, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " this ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "man",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " was born there. Selah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.87.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.87.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As well the singers as the players on instruments ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be there",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ": all my springs ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
